Create a new activity called ActivityConfidenceActivity with a layout that contains a TextView for each activity (walking, running, sitting, and jumping). Update the TextView with the confidence values in the onHandleIntent() method of the ActivityRecognitionService.

Don’t forget to add your new activity to your AndroidManifest.xml. Now, when the user opens this activity, they will see the confidence values for each detected activity.
